{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18942","headline":"宿诚禅师山房题赠二首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"宿诚禅师山房题赠二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不出孤峰上，人间四十秋。\n视身如传舍，阅世似东流。\n法爲因缘立，心从次第修。\n中宵问真偈，有住是吾忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}